Package: runsloth
Title: R Interface to 'Unsloth' via 'reticulate'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrew Gene", "Brown", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "brown.andrewg@gmail.com")
Description: Wraps the 'Python' library 'Unsloth' through 'reticulate' for fine-tuning, inference, and export of large language models. 'Python' is only initialized when an 'Unsloth'-backed function is first called.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    cli,
    reticulate (>= 1.34.0),
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
